{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20267sVcOeO47e1795256706.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>葵涌一間中學有五名學生被墜下的石屎擊中，輕傷送院。</p><p></p><p>現場是安捷街裘錦秋中學，警方上午10時許接報，有五名學生被石屎擊中受輕傷，送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。調查指，校內正進行升降機工程。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T11:23:52.005209+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T00:13:37.810055+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T11:17:13.717232+00:00","content_hash":"0b0ad569017fae2947e71c9d5b470747c5eb148c70b281fc4fb1f0959f53ec98","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T11:23:52.005209+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}